senses.gloss:
हलि, इस्, m. a large plough, ploughshare (=
जित्या, Vopa-deva XXVI. 20; = वृहद्-धल, q. v.);
a furrow (according to some); agriculture.

हलिन्, ई, m. a ploughman, agriculturist, cultivator;
N. of Bala-rāma; (इनी), f. a number of ploughs;
a kind of plant (= लाङ्गलिकी).
—हलि-प्रिय, अस्,
m. ‘dear to agriculturists,’ the Kadamba tree; (आ),
f. spirituous liquor (= मदिरा).
